      "identificador": 4729601,
      "título": null,
      "cuerpo": "<p>Back when he was in high school, my dad ran for senior class president on the slogan of </p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>\"Slicer is Nicer\".</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>Well, I may certainly be nice too, and that will be tempered with patience, respect and professionalism.  As a professional developer for over 15 years and a technology hobbyist since 1982, I believe you'll find I will do well to keep this community moving forward and bringing the best practices of development to aspiring technologists.</p>",
      "id de respuesta aceptada": null,
      "número de respuestas": null,
      "número de comentarios": 0,
      "fecha_propiedad_comunitaria": 1295388481350000,
