    {
      "identificador": 4729691,
      "título": null,
      "cuerpo": "<p>I firmly believe that a good moderator is like a good pre-school teacher.  Willing to listen to all, to help others better themselves, be there to arbitrate disagreements and able to learn from their <em>own</em> mistakes.  I may not be the best developer around (there are many before me who have a better claim to that title), but I think I can be fair.</p>\n\n<p>Holy crap, I just compared all the members of this site to pre-school children.  Well, there goes <em>my</em> nomination!</p>",
      "id de respuesta aceptada": null,
      "número de respuestas": null,
      "número de comentarios": 0,
